/Pg 16 0 R
/K [18]
>>
endobj
317 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 54 0 R
/E (Answer: YOLO and SSD are single-stage object detection methods designed for fast detection.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [19]
>>
endobj
318 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 54 0 R
/E (Faster R-CNN is a two-stage object detection method that first generates region proposals and then performs classification and localization.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [20]
>>
endobj
319 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 54 0 R
