/Pg 16 0 R
/K [22]
>>
endobj
321 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 54 0 R
/E (Answer: A bounding box is a rectangular box surrounding a detected object in an image.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [23]
>>
endobj
322 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 54 0 R
/E (It is important because it provides the location and approximate size of the detected object.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [24]
>>
endobj
323 0 obj
<<
