/Pg 16 0 R
/K [25]
>>
endobj
324 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 54 0 R
/E (Answer: A confidence score represents the model's confidence in a particular object detection.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [26]
>>
endobj
325 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 54 0 R
/E (IoU stands for Intersection over Union.)
